{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_6d49d75c7f02dd38-458\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>徐榮育有一子一女，適逢愛女「包包」徐心怡迎來 11 歲生日，徐榮一家特意合體為包包溫馨慶生，並在社交平台分享全家福合照，溫馨畫面羨煞旁人。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_6d49d75c7f02dd38-459\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_6d49d75c7f02dd38-459\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>徐榮在社交網感性發文，大讚女兒已成長為一名熱愛唱歌跳舞的美少女，並寫道：「眨吓眼，我哋嘅小情人包姐 11 歲生日啦！🎂✨ 時間真係過得太快啦、而家已經變成熱愛唱歌跳舞嘅美少女🥺 雖然你大得好快，但係👨🏻👩🏻👦🏻心目中，你始終都係我哋最愛錫嘅小女孩👧🏻！❤️祝包姐 11 歲生日快樂！新一歲年繼續開開心心😊健康活潑🤗做你想做嘅事！屋企三個最強後盾永遠都咁愛你支持你🥰💪🏻」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_6d49d75c7f02dd38-459\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"48aae8be-f9e5-41e7-bb4f-7c85be602c76.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/202623huzR6u8Z1791281711.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"48aae8be-f9e5-41e7-bb4f-7c85be602c76.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e0e5e721-a3f9-4514-8353-635add5e6a78.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026be26bc24b71791281711.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e0e5e721-a3f9-4514-8353-635add5e6a78.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_6d49d75c7f02dd38-460\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_6d49d75c7f02dd38-460\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>不少香港觀眾及網民對包包都十分熟悉，皆因她在 BB 時期就曾客串處境劇《愛·回家》飾演「馬家好」，精靈可愛的形象深得民心，可以說香港觀眾是一路看着包包成長。照片中，11 歲的包包手捧寫有「11」字樣蠟燭的生日蛋糕，笑容甜美。帖文曝光後，大批網民紛紛留言送上祝福，留言道：「生日快樂」、「愈大愈靚女」、「睇住包包成長，好感動」，對她的成長感到既欣慰又驚喜。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T11:00:17.174996+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":433,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}